{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2023-03-16 07:55:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK® CANADA ANNOUNCES MARCH CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES® ETFS', 'text': 'TORONTO, MARCH 16, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BLACKROCK ASSET MANAGEMENT CANADA LIMITED (“BLACKROCK CANADA”), AN INDIRECT, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE: BLK), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE MARCH 2023 CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES ETFS LISTED ON THE TSX OR NEO WHICH PAY ON A MONTHLY OR QUARTERLY BASIS. UNITHOLDERS OF RECORD OF A FUND ON MARCH 23, 2023 WILL RECEIVE CASH DISTRIBUTIONS PAYABLE IN RESPECT OF THAT FUND ON MARCH 31, 2023. DETAILS REGARDING THE “PER UNIT” DISTRIBUTION AMOUNTS ARE AS FOLLOWS:'}